== Notes ==

*The bonus to attack provided by this spell counts towards the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].
*The "bonus to maximum hit points" is implemented as [[temporary hit point]]s.
*The temporary hit points [[stack]] with multiple castings of this spell. (A fix for this is available on the Vault<sup>[http://nwvault.ign.com/View.php?view=Scripts.Detail&id=3739]</sup>).
*Due to a .2da bug, ''aid'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of ''doom''.

